{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05f3853c605458ecc91352c87e901ba46fdc9086a4caabdc069e8e34d1a948b3", "ja": "（今日は野外で、紬の撮影だ。\nだが、肝心の天気はというと……）", "zh": "（今天䌷要在室外进行拍摄。\n但最为关键的天气却……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d2f76972e06708c0db74cea37ecbc376ec853975bef55ca4feb64dfbe7a651d0", "ja": "まずいな。\n空は晴れてるのに、さっきから雨が……。", "zh": "真糟糕。\n天空明明是晴朗的，但雨从刚才就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc5dec41389d8ad55c90eb0c7c09b26cbdab732efceaa6c50735726bb46ffcdf", "ja": "そうですね。先ほどから、降ったり止んだり……。\nなんとも、思わせぶりなことです。", "zh": "对啊，就刚才开始就下下停停的……\n像在吊人胃口似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e2b875e46424cc5a4fee3ccfcbfea3d47dbdac29405e6e4b210b24d7809f74a7", "ja": "これも、私が狐役をまかされたせいなのでしょうか？\n何やら責任を感じます……。", "zh": "这难道也是因为扮演狐狸的人是我才会这样吗？\n感觉自己好像该负责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ea710812820de92da81585c3ca58fac4eb0ae063b695aa4de448765d314368be", "ja": "紬のせいじゃないさ。\nそもそも、狐の嫁入りに雨はつきものらしいしな。", "zh": "不是䌷的错啦。\n说起来，狐狸娶亲好像本来就会下雨的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "72cffce36f330db3af168901b3c8174c4384b250fca8ba6c486048fdbe716df0", "ja": "紬は狐の嫁入りに相応しいアイドルだって、\n天気にも認められたって事なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想这是老天认可䌷你确实是个\n足以担当狐狸娶亲角色的偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b5099cba2cfcd727f85b80bfa07f394f4a09a481a7ad8bfb2f32fa7e9e5f403a", "ja": "お天気に認められる……ですか？\nあなたという方は、また適当な事を……。", "zh": "老天认可吗……？\n你这个人真是的，又在胡诌了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ddd7fa7cbae977d56070c7a160aff73bdd4db9cf802651da5e3481f31d456bdf", "ja": "けど、不思議です。お天気に認められたというのは、\nあまり悪い気はしませんね。", "zh": "不过，真是奇妙。\n被老天认可的感觉并不差呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "314dba706ec85c4a7ac09989b4768ccc9b472e22604158b662eaa06dd0e595f0", "ja": "とはいえ、これ以上待ち時間が続くと、\n昼間の撮影ができなくなってしまうのでは……。", "zh": "虽说如此，再继续等下去的话，\n不就没办法在白天拍摄了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e", "ja": "そうだな……。", "zh": "是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28bcca49aa998f8f10ed7adc5d3a16b8efffcb2a80c60cd9ea1184f15eca0ef8", "ja": "{$P$}。\nならば、この雨を利用してみてはいかがでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n既然如此，何不干脆借用这场雨呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d00a016475afacd84da085b203d712c76953affeed63347e3635c4bfb41302f7", "ja": "私が狐の花嫁ならば、狐の嫁入りらしく……\n雨の中で、撮影をしていただくのです。", "zh": "既然我是狐狸的新娘，\n那为何不就和狐狸娶亲一样……在雨中进行拍摄呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aa5462e036a0115e1503f095c29461e6098aa9f5710ff73e21157050116358b1", "ja": "もちろん、この衣装が濡れることと……\nカメラマンさんがよろしければ、ではありますが。", "zh": "当然，前提是要这套服装不怕湿……\n以及摄影师也同意就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "374cddaf16c09bde987f7f79378b63c95b9af3419727da683e175ef8249dc597", "ja": "なるほど、天気雨を逆に利用するのか。\nそれはいいアイディアだな！", "zh": "原来如此，反过来利用这阵太阳雨是吧。\n这点子真棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a899d3a2fd264f63d1e5169ac2d7860091be95cd43a934cb517cfcd7da64c5c7", "ja": "衣装については、多少なら問題ないはずだ。\nカメラマンさんに、早速確認してみよう。", "zh": "服装稍微弄湿应该是没关系。\n至于摄影师那边……我马上去确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "65a73a5dd1d196b4e30b5e3065f57a8953ff63579d86ccee5a374d4b04667fdf", "ja": "ええ。よろしくお願いいたします。\n……あ、それと、もうひとつ大事なことが。", "zh": "好，就麻烦你了。\n……啊，我还有一件重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f82930ad3c8f73a2c0ee6a9fe9e62afa9c71f45b8f20e56f12930b68247e0fa1", "ja": "大事なこと？", "zh": "重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "becd961e5ddbf7ddc3fd5aa704c1635957045ac2858b3cbaa8c806e78fd64d4d", "ja": "はい。この衣装が濡れた時のお手入れ方法を、\n青羽さんに確認していただきたいのです。", "zh": "是的，希望你可以帮我询问青羽小姐，\n这套服装湿掉该怎么清洁跟保养。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55a145369db45838bae4fe180fdb1115b76d3edf92c8ceec21a942f80029e78a", "ja": "せっかくの衣装が傷んでしまっては、\n悲しいですから。", "zh": "要是伤到了这么美的服装，\n我会很难过的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "57bc706bdfad419afe51d00f04aff58f11f01784e2090928785f97e39ee5f3a9", "ja": "衣装の手入れ方法か、わかった。\n青羽さんに電話で確認しておくよ。", "zh": "保养服装的方法啊，我知道了。\n我会打电话问青羽小姐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1b250e41777c22993b66f32ee1d6fe33de959012d8c1912ba6cbc92c2c7436cd", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれでは私も、改めて準備をしてまいります。", "zh": "非常感谢。\n那么，我也要再去准备拍摄的事宜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3485a865a298ff0fed20b7db77c0087e5a3d0db02571f4b0b3fcc0f3beaacd48", "ja": "ああ。頼んだぞ、紬！", "zh": "嗯，拜托你啰，䌷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4a4d1c05d15493cce60e34dedac90c6589bda40e27adbefb2bfc5c844b5ab46e", "ja": "はい。……今日の私は、狐の花嫁。であれば、\n天気雨さえも味方につけてみせましょう。ふふっ！", "zh": "好的……今天的我是狐狸的新娘。\n那么，太阳雨也将会成为我的助力，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0124_1023_p", "source_sha256": "52e836ad4de9b13d7750eb5fcd064433ff5ec108f98f5f72ae035d4829492b2d", "ja": "（その後、カメラマンさんは願ってもないと了承。\n結果、最高の写真が撮れた……やったな、紬！）", "zh": "（后来，摄影师说求之不得，爽快地答应了。\n最后拍出了最棒的照片……太棒了呢，䌷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
